[%# The keys that the runner authorizes on every guest it builds, one per
    line, in the format that sshd reads.

    Unless the domain names its own keys, these are the keys that built this
    guest.  So a runner administers its guests the same way as this
    installation.  They are a file, not an identity for cloud-init to resolve,
    so they need this template.

    No apostrophes in an Xslate comment.  The lexer reads one as the start of
    a string, and takes the template up to the next quote into it. -%]
[% FOR key IN config.admin_keys -%]
[% key %]
[% END -%]
